# The Settings dialog from the control bar: the account section (signed out:
# Sign in with StarHermit), More options; the dialog's ✕ closes it and the
# board still plays by the buttons (Move left eats morsel 1).
until 300 Hollow Feast
frames 150
click =Settings
until 60 Sign in with StarHermit
frames 20
expect More options
save settings
click =Close settings
frames 20
click =Move left
frames 10
expect 1 / 12
expect 10
save moved
click =Restart round
frames 10
expect 0 / 12
